00:01.040" end="00:01.115">Produced</span><span begin="00:01.115" end="00:01.190"> </span><span begin="00:01.190" end="00:01.265">by</span><span begin="00:01.265" end="00:01.340">：</span><span begin="00:01.340" end="00:01.415">Josh</span><span begin="00:01.415" end="00:01.490"> </span><span begin="00:01.490" end="00:01.565">Conway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.572" end="00:03.926"><span begin="00:01.572" end="00:01.796">Please </span><span begin="00:01.796" end="00:02.148">tell </span><span begin="00:02.148" end="00:02.565">me </span><span begin="00:02.565" end="00:02.917">not </span><span begin="00:02.917" end="00:03.237">to </span><span begin="00:03.237" end="00:03.926">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.004" end="00:10.292"><span begin="00:08.004" end="00:08.228">We've </span><span begin="00:08.228" end="00:08.600">been </span><span begin="00:08.600" end="00:09.013">here </span><span begin="00:09.013" end="00:09.508">long </span><span begin="00:09.508" end="00:10.292">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.517" end="00:18.785"><span begin="00:14.517" end="00:14.776">I </span><span begin="00:14.776" end="00:15.284">live </span><span begin="00:15.284" end="00:15.813">under </span><span begin="00:15.813" end="00:16.212">your </span><span begin="00:16.212" end="00:18.785">eyelids</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.897" end="00:23.440"><span begin="00:20.897" end="00:21.216">I'll </span><span begin="00:21.216" end="00:22.048">always </span><span begin="00:22.048" end="00:22.529">be </span><span begin="00:22.529" end="00:23.440">yours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.457" end="00:32.514"><span begin="00:27.457" end="00:27.697">I'll </span><span begin="00:27.697" end="00:28.017">lay </span><span begin="00:28.017" end="00:28.385">on </span><span begin="00:28.385" end="00:28.706">your </span><span begin="00:28.706" end="00:30.481">rooftop </span><span begin="00:30.481" end="00:30.706">in </span><span begin="00:30.706" end="00:30.913">the </span><span begin="00:30.913" end="00:31.650">freezing </span><span begin="00:31.650" end="00:32.514">cold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.729" end="00:38.914"><span begin="00:33.729" end="00:33.920">And </span><span begin="00:33.920" end="00:34.145">I'll </span><span begin="00:34.145" end="00:34.546">watch </span><span begin="00:34.546" end="00:34.865">the </span><span begin="00:34.865" end="00:36.835">sunset </span><span begin="00:36.835" end="00:37.154">wearing </span><span begin="00:37.154" end="00:37.538">all </span><span begin="00:37.538" end="00:38.003">your </span><span begin="00:38.003" end="00:38.914">clothes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.210" end="00:45.428"><span begin="00:40.210" end="00:40.434">I </span><span begin="00:40.434" end="00:40.660">can </span><span begin="00:40.660" end="00:40.994">feel </span><span begin="00:40.994" end="00:41.363">you </span><span begin="00:41.363" end="00:41.811">with </span><span begin="00:41.811" end="00:43.364">me </span><span begin="00:43.364" end="00:43.619">like </span><span begin="00:43.619" end="00:43.859">I </span><span begin="00:43.859" end="00:44.275">did </span><span begin="00:44.275" end="00:45.428">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.547" end="00:51.858"><span begin="00:46.547" end="00:46.738">Like </span><span begin="00:46.738" end="00:46.948">when </span><span begin="00:46.948" end="00:47.139">I </span><span begin="00:47.139" end="00:47.428">sang </span><span begin="00:47.428" end="00:47.747">you </span><span begin="00:47.747" end="00:47.923">a </span><span begin="00:47.923" end="00:48.210">love </span><span begin="00:48.210" end="00:49.763">song </span><span begin="00:49.763" end="00:50.194">by </span><span begin="00:50.194" end="00:51.026">Norah </span><span begin="00:51.026" end="00:51.858">Jones</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.118" end="01:01.862"><span begin="00:52.118" end="00:54.950">Ooh </span><span begin="00:54.950" end="01:00.262">Sienna </span><span begin="01:00.262" end="01:00.774">would've </span><span begin="01:00.774" end="01:01.206">been </span><span begin="01:01.206" end="01:01.862">cute</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.961" end="01:14.720"><span begin="01:04.961" end="01:07.984">Ooh </span><span begin="01:07.984" end="01:13.104">Sienna </span><span begin="01:13.104" end="01:13.313">would </span><span begin="01:13.313" end="01:13.537">look </span><span begin="01:13.537" end="01:13.856">just </span><span begin="01:13.856" end="01:14.241">like </span><span begin="01:14.241" end="01:14.720">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.744" end="01:29.360"><span begin="01:19.744" end="01:21.520">I </span><span begin="01:21.520" end="01:22.290">came </span><span begin="01:22.290" end="01:26.241">clean </span><span begin="01:26.241" end="01:26.464">and </span><span begin="01:26.464" end="01:27.408">it </span><span begin="01:27.408" end="01:28.016">feels </span><span begin="01:28.016" end="01:28.848">so </span><span begin="01:28.848" end="01:29.360">good</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.672" end="01:42.368"><span begin="01:32.672" end="01:34.624">But </span><span begin="01:34.624" end="01:34.849">I </span><span begin="01:34.849" end="01:35.250">feel </span><span begin="01:35.250" end="01:39.217">seen </span><span begin="01:39.217" end="01:41.167">only </span><span begin="01:41.167" end="01:41.905">through </span><span begin="01:41.905" end="01:42.368">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.864" end="01:51.921"><span begin="01:46.864" end="01:47.138">I'll </span><span begin="01:47.138" end="01:47.584">wait </span><span begin="01:47.584" end="01:47.872">here </span><span begin="01:47.872" end="01:49.984">tomorrow </span><span begin="01:49.984" end="01:50.640">outside </span><span begin="01:50.640" end="01:51.040">your </span><span begin="01:51.040" end="01:51.921">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.184" end="01:58.305"><span begin="01:53.184" end="01:53.376">Like </span><span begin="01:53.376" end="01:53.584">I </span><span begin="01:53.584" end="01:53.921">did </span><span begin="01:53.921" end="01:54.177">in </span><span begin="01:54.177" end="01:56.400">December </span><span begin="01:56.400" end="01:56.608">when </span><span begin="01:56.608" end="01:56.816">you </span><span begin="01:56.816" end="01:57.152">held </span><span begin="01:57.152" end="01:57.536">me </span><span begin="01:57.536" end="01:58.305">close</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.873" end="02:04.786"><span begin="01:59.873" end="02:00.064">Coming </span><span begin="02:00.064" end="02:00.256">up </span><span begin="02:00.256" end="02:00.480">on </span><span begin="02:00.480" end="02:00.815">your </span><span begin="02:00.815" end="02:03.184">corner </span><span begin="02:03.184" end="02:03.392">pulling </span><span begin="02:03.392" end="02:03.712">out </span><span begin="02:03.712" end="02:04.048">my </span><span begin="02:04.048" end="02:04.786">hair</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.192" end="02:11.152"><span begin="02:06.192" end="02:06.384">Hear </span><span begin="02:06.384" end="02:06.592">the </span><span begin="02:06.592" end="02:06.944">creak </span><span begin="02:06.944" end="02:07.139">in </span><span begin="02:07.139" end="02:07.359">the </span><span begin="02:07.359" end="02:09.408">floorboards </span><span begin="02:09.408" end="02:09.664">going </span><span begin="02:09.664" end="02:10.016">up </span><span begin="02:10.016" end="02:10.448">the </span><span begin="02:10.448" end="02:11.152">stairs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.627" end="02:21.292"><span begin="02:11.627" end="02:14.443">Ooh </span><span begin="02:14.443" end="02:19.739">Sienna </span><span begin="02:19.739" end="02:20.444">would've </span><span begin="02:20.444" end="02:20.748">been </span><span begin="02:20.748" end="02:21.292">cute</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.507" end="02:34.235"><span begin="02:24.507" end="02:27.435">Ooh </span><span begin="02:27.435" end="02:32.555">Sienna </span><span begin="02:32.555" end="02:32.747">would </span><span begin="02:32.747" end="02:32.955">look </span><span begin="02:32.955" end="02:33.259">just </span><span begin="02:33.259" end="02:33.643">like </span><span begin="02:33.643" end="02:34.235">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.748" end="02:42.012"><span begin="02:36.748" end="02:37.035">With </span><span begin="02:37.035" end="02:37.419">a </span><span begin="02:37.419" end="02:37.791">temper </span><span begin="02:37.791" end="02:38.075">like </span><span begin="02:38.075" end="02:40.475">you </span><span begin="02:40.475" end="02:40.685">run </span><span begin="02:40.685" end="02:40.955">around </span><span begin="02:40.955" end="02:41.342">like </span><span begin="02:41.342" end="02:42.012">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.611" end="02:47.243"><span begin="02:43.611" end="02:43.836">Jumping </span><span begin="02:43.836" end="02:44.187">in </span><span begin="02:44.187" end="02:44.571">the </span><span begin="02:44.571" end="02:46.459">pool </span><span begin="02:46.459" end="02:46.779">like </span><span begin="02:46.779" end="02:47.243">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.963" end="02:55.003"><span begin="02:49.963" end="02:50.171">Sing </span><span begin="02:50.171" end="02:50.379">to </span><span begin="02:50.379" end="02:50.699">all </span><span begin="02:50.699" end="02:51.067">her </span><span begin="02:51.067" end="02:53.179">pets </span><span begin="02:53.179" end="02:53.371">in </span><span begin="02:53.371" end="02:53.579">the </span><span begin="02:53.579" end="02:53.899">way </span><span begin="02:53.899" end="02:54.283">I </span><span begin="02:54.283" end="02:55.003">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.668" end="03:00.139"><span begin="02:56.668" end="02:56.875">Be </span><span begin="02:56.875" end="02:59.514">sensitive </span><span begin="02:59.514" end="02:59.756">like </span><span begin="02:59.756" end="03:00.139">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.533" end="03:09.703"><span begin="03:04.533" end="03:04.725">And </span><span begin="03:04.725" end="03:04.918">I </span><span begin="03:04.918" end="03:05.254">smile </span><span begin="03:05.254" end="03:05.430">when </span><span begin="03:05.430" end="03:05.670">I </span><span begin="03:05.670" end="03:06.023">think </span><span begin="03:06.023" end="03:07.926">of </span><span begin="03:07.926" end="03:08.102">all </span><span begin="03:08.102" end="03:08.294">the </span><span begin="03:08.294" end="03:08.549">times </span><span begin="03:08.549" end="03:08.920">we </span><span begin="03:08.920" end="03:09.703">had</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.009" end="03:16.016"><span begin="03:11.009" end="03:11.200">On </span><span begin="03:11.200" end="03:11.409">the </span><span begin="03:11.409" end="03:11.744">beach </span><span begin="03:11.744" end="03:11.952">in </span><span begin="03:11.952" end="03:12.208">the </span><span begin="03:12.208" end="03:14.224">winter </span><span begin="03:14.224" end="03:14.416">when </span><span begin="03:14.416" end="03:14.624">the </span><span begin="03:14.624" end="03:14.960">waves </span><span begin="03:14.960" end="03:15.362">were </span><span begin="03:15.362" end="03:16.016">mad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.975" end="03:22.648"><span begin="03:17.975" end="03:18.233">Down </span><span begin="03:18.233" end="03:18.455">by </span><span begin="03:18.455" end="03:18.729">the </span><span begin="03:18.729" end="03:21.239">water </span><span begin="03:21.239" end="03:21.864">crystal </span><span begin="03:21.864" end="03:22.648">clear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.056" end="03:29.592"><span begin="03:24.056" end="03:24.248">See </span><span begin="03:24.248" end="03:24.424">her </span><span begin="03:24.424" end="03:24.679">face </span><span begin="03:24.679" end="03:24.887">in </span><span begin="03:24.887" end="03:25.127">the </span><span begin="03